ver fears Allāh - He will make for him a way out","j":28,"h":56,"s":65,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"65:3","t":"And will provide for him from where he does not expect. And whoever relies upon Allāh - then He is sufficient for him. Indeed, Allāh will accomplish His purpose. Allāh has already set for everything a [decreed] extent.","j":28,"h":56,"s":65,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"65:4","t":"And those who no longer expect menstruation among your women - if you doubt, then their period is three months, and [also for] those who have not menstruated. And for those who are pregnant, their term is until they give birth. And whoever fears Allāh - He will make for him of his matter ease.","j":28,"h":56,"s":65,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"65:5","t":"That is the command of Allāh, which He has sent down to you; and whoever fears Allāh - He will remove for him his misdeeds and make great for him his reward.","j":28,"h":56,"s":65,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":28,"hizb":56,"surahs":[65],"sajdah":false}